s/v1/","context":{"app_id":1270660,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-1270660","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:30:56Z","value":6,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4896490","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1847286114034424","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"announcement","title":"We made Dead Block for XBLA in 2011. Here’s why we decided to return to it.","summary":"The whole journey started back in 2005. I was completely obsessed with that classic zombie movie trope: a ragtag group of people barricaded inside a house, desperately trying to survive against an endless horde outside. I built a super rough prototype back then—literally just a guy blocking windows and scavenging for random junk—but even in its crudest form, the core fun was already there.A few screenshots from the earliest prototype of Dead Block that was created 2005Fast forward to 2009. A few","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:14:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034424","verified_at":"2026-10-23T00:37:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1846651706691721","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"announcement","title":"Check out the Updated Dead Party Demo in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone,We are excited to announce that Dead Party is participating in Next Fest, with an updated demo! Along with the original 4 levels already in the demo, we added the Museum, a Fuel Run level that will test your ability to work together. You can unlock the Museum level by completing all the other levels in the demo, and if you have already done so this level will already be unlocked! The Museum introduces a new mechanic: security gates that check whether a room is free of zombies before","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:19:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691721","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1846651706679539","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"announcement","title":"Mark Your Calendars: Dead Party Launches October 29th","summary":"Hello everyone, We have a date. Dead Party launches on October 29th, TWO days before Halloween, right when Shady Hill needs you most. Clear your schedules, gather your friends and maybe start stretching those guitar fingers.We wanted this one to land at the right moment and the zombie onslaught is restless, awaiting the Halloween rush. The UFOs are already circling and you now have a deadline to gather your squad.Now, the good stuff. We have been keeping a few gameplay details close to our chest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:13:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679539","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1844115010502739","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Stats and 5,000+ Wishlists!","summary":"THANKS FOR PLAYING!12,800+ TOTAL UNIQUE USERS MEDIAN TIME PLAYED: 32 MINUTES THANK YOU, SHADY HILL DEFENDERS!The undead have been relentless and so have you.Since the Dead Party Demo went live, players have jumped into Shady Hill 12,824 times this week to barricade defenses, hold back zombie hordes, battle the alien invasion, and discover just how much trouble four survivors can cause together.Whether you faced the Horde alone, defended the town with friends, or turned zombie skulls into UFO-tar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T23:43:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502739","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1842212951313710","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"update","title":"Dead Party Demo Hotfix Patch 3","summary":"Hi everyone!We've been keeping momentum with another hotfix to address a few more issues and to polish up some parts based on recent testing.Hotfix Changelog:Clients that join later to a stage can now see bot character avatars in their HUD.Bots that are available in the story mode will now be visible in the player lobby screen.If \"Add Bots\" is selected in the arcade mode, they will also be visible when hovering over the map during the map selection phase.Bots are only in a level during story mod","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T15:05:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1841579228666814","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"update","title":"Dead Party Demo Hotfix Patch 2","summary":"Hello everyone, We have been busy at work and we're back with another hotfix to address a few extra issues we caught over the last few days!Please see the full list below:Bots now get correctly initialized when another player joins an ongoing multiplayer gameFixed a visual glitch where the prompter remained visible for one second after taking Weapons, Keys, or Level ItemsBreakable walls that involve hidden interactables and important window/wall positions now get correct damage on clients that j","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T20:53:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666814","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1840944183789723","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"update","title":"Dead Party Demo Hotfix Patch 1","summary":"Hello everyone,Thank you everyone who has already tried out the demo, we hope you are enjoying the preview of the party so far!We've updated the demo with a hotfix patch to address some issues we noticed with the demo. Check out the full list below:Fixed session list in join menu when displaying more than 10 sessions.Polished session list - usernames and maps are now separate. Removed filter options for Story and Arcade item setup.Searching for sessions text is now only visible when searching.Fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T19:16:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183789723","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1840944183780573","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"announcement","title":"A preview of the party, Demo out now!","summary":"Hello everyone, Today, we are releasing the Dead Party demo, live right now on Steam free to play, no strings attached. It’s just you, your friends, and whatever the zombies have decided to throw at Shady Hill.This is your first real taste of what we have been building. Jump in solo or grab up to three friends and see how long you last when the zombies start crawling and the music starts playing. What is in the demo you ask?4 levels of Story mode with varying levels of size and difficulty:Party ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T19:00:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183780573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1839676055883852","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"announcement","title":"Dead Party at ChinaJoy 2026 – Come See Us at Booth N1-G306!","summary":"Hello everyone,We are thrilled to announce that Dead Party will be making its way to ChinaJoy 2026! We warmly invite all players to drop by our booth for hands-on demos, conversations with our team, and exclusive giveaways!About ChinaJoy Founded in 2004, ChinaJoy has grown into one of the largest and most influential digital entertainment expos in the world. The 2026 edition will feature over 140,000 square metres of exhibition space and nearly 900 participating companies. More than 500 game pub","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T00:45:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883852","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1270660-1836506165584646","game_id":"steam-1270660","kind":"announcement","title":"We're Back, the Zombies are too...","summary":"Hello everyone,Some of you might remember a little game called Dead Block, a zombie barricading, rock-n-roll fueled romp that hit consoles way back in 2011. Well, the team behind it never stopped loving that music-forward mayhem. Fast forward to today, we're thrilled to officially say hello from our new home here on Steam: Dead Party is real, it's coming, and it's everything we wished Dead Block could have been back then and then some.For the Dead Block fans out there, this one's for you. Dead P","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T21:47:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165584646","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1270660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1270660":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1270660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z"},"4896490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:19Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1270660","app_id":1270660,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"47d1048eaff082102754b08539bd7b37f82ed2d34460de4bb7ede7ba33d4be8a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"On Halloween, UFO‘s appeared over the peaceful town of Shady Hill. Soon after, the undead neighborhood rises from their graves. Four heroes take on the impossible task: to fight back the evil invaders!","publishers":[{"name":"Snail Games USA","creator_clan_account_id":32938488}],"developers":[{"name":"Radiation Blue"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793293200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1786991807","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"1270660/901744719/f6fb26dcd5ff655d13f91d4d38fdec4ea0ebdbd6/1786735438/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"1270660/901744719/f6fb26d